{"strongs": "H7131", "word": "קָרֵב", "translit": "qa.rev", "root": "קצף", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "verbal adjective", "gloss": "approaching", "definition": "קָרֵב verbal adjective approaching ; — ׳ ק 1Sam 17:41 +; plural קְרִבִים Ezek 40:46 ; Ezek 45:4 — approaching: 1. as predicate, אֶלדָּֿוִד ׳ הֹלֵח וְק 1Sam 17:14 , אַתֶּס קְרֵבִים לַמִּלְחָמָה Deut 20:8 abs ׳ הָלוֺח וְק 2Sam 18:25 c, article as substantive, 1Kgs 5:7 (+ אֶלוֺשֻׁלְחָן ), Num 17:28 (twice in verse) (+ אֶלֿ ׳ מִשְׁכַּן י ). 2. with article approaching ׳ י temple or tabernacle, for service, with לְשָׁרֵת Exod 40:46 (+ ׳ אֶליֿ ), Exod 45:4 absolute ׳ הַוָּר הַקּ Num 1:51 ; Num 3:10 ; Num 3:38 ; Num 18:7 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7559')\">BDB7559</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7131')\">H7131</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7558')\">BDB7558</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7560')\">BDB7560</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קָרֵב</bdbheb> <b>verbal adjective</b> <highlightword>approaching</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:41\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,41)\">1Sam 17:41</ref> +; plural <bdbheb>קְרִבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:46\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,46)\">Ezek 40:46</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,4)\">Ezek 45:4</ref> — <highlight>approaching:</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> as predicate, <bdbheb>אֶלדָּֿוִד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֹלֵח וְק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,14)\">1Sam 17:14</ref>, <bdbheb>אַתֶּס קְרֵבִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לַמִּלְחָמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 20:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,8)\">Deut 20:8</ref> abs <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb>